sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client
    participant Gateway as vllm-orchestrator-gateway<br/>8090/TCP HTTP
    participant Orchestrator as FMS Guardrails Orchestrator<br/>8085/TCP HTTP/HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Client,Orchestrator: Flow 1: Non-Streaming Chat Completion
        Client->>Gateway: POST /{route}/v1/chat/completions<br/>Authorization header<br/>Content-Type: application/json
        Note right of Gateway: Inject route detector config<br/>into request payload
        Gateway->>Orchestrator: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>Forwarded Authorization + x-forwarded-* headers<br/>Optional mTLS
        Orchestrator-->>Gateway: JSON response with detections[]
        alt Detections found & fallback configured
            Note right of Gateway: Replace response choices<br/>with fallback_message
            Gateway-->>Client: JSON response (fallback message)
        else No detections or no fallback
            Gateway-->>Client: JSON response (original)
        end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over Client,Orchestrator: Flow 2: Streaming Chat Completion (SSE)
        Client->>Gateway: POST /{route}/v1/chat/completions<br/>Authorization header<br/>stream: true
        Note right of Gateway: Inject route detector config<br/>into request payload
        Gateway->>Orchestrator: POST /api/v2/chat/completions-detection<br/>Forwarded Authorization + x-forwarded-* headers<br/>Optional mTLS
        loop Each SSE chunk
            Orchestrator-->>Gateway: SSE chunk (data: {...})
            Note right of Gateway: Deserialize chunk<br/>Check for detections<br/>Apply fallback if needed<br/>Re-serialize
            Gateway-->>Client: SSE chunk (data: {...})
        end
        Orchestrator-->>Gateway: SSE done (data: [DONE])
        Gateway-->>Client: SSE done (data: [DONE])
    end
